  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (pca_n2000 RNA + resnet50 image) achieves the highest accuracy so far. This experiment tests whether switching the image encoder to imagenet_vit_l (a more advanced architecture) with the same RNA encoder (pca_n2000) improves performance. It isolates the effect of the image encoder while keeping other parameters consistent, helping determine if this change is critical. This is a focused exploration of a key design choice with potential to yield actionable insights."
